        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1106_334521_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; display: inline !important; float: none">Revenue earned from CAISO per the revenue requirement for transmission services filed with FERC.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1263_334522_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; display: inline !important; float: none">17.51 miles of the Harry Allen - El Dorado line are located on structures not owned by DesertLink, LLC and as such no expenses are associated with these structures.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1310_334523_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p><span style="color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-family: sans-serif; font-size: medium; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; display: inline !important; float: none">The Capacity value is based on the 4 Hour Emergency Rating of the Series Capacitor Station.</span><br /></p></link:footnote>
        <link:footnote xlink:label="ft-1485_336104_lbl" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:type="resource" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>Formula template references page 262-263 column (i); Changes to Form No. 1 page 262-263 have moved data to column (l)<br /></p></link:footnote>
